scenario sc over rb
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

place nowa: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask s1: bal(sav, 2026-02-28), bal(nowa, 2026-02-28) in sc
ask s1b: stated[sav] in sc law 2026-02-28
ask s2: explain bal(nowa, 2026-02-28) in sc
ask s4: last(stated[nowa], 2026-03-01), bal(p, 2026-02-28) for p in accounts on 2026-02-28 in sc

version sc_v
  cite card
  governs 2026-01..2026-02
  known 2026-03-05
  anchor sav
  anchor nowa
  opening[sav] = 5 at 2026-01-01 start "sc"
  stated[sav] = 50 at 2026-02-28 start "sc"
  stated[nowa] = 9 at 2026-02-10 end "sc"
